<title>USA: Dow industrials, Nasdaq open up.</title>
<headline>Dow industrials, Nasdaq open up.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street opened higher on Monday , carried forward by the momentum of the recent strong performance in U.S. stocks.</p>
<p>The Dow Industrials were up 13.19 at 7182.72 and the Nasdaq Composite was up 4.8 at 1339.85.</p>
</text>
